### The second consumer — scope-rotation (cr-0092). Same blind boundary: auth before anything, and a non-
### key-holder never gets a rotation job (the happy path is a signed key-holder flow, covered at the slice +
### web-worker layers; a bare .http can't mint the ML-KEM re-grants). `663157d8` = scope-rotation.

### 12. scope-rotation claim without a bearer token → generic 401 (auth before anything)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/claim
Content-Type: application/json

{ "capabilityTags": ["663157d8"] }

> {%
client.test("scope-rotation claim requires auth", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 401, "expected 401, got " + response.status);
    client.assert(response.body.code === "authentication_failed", "expected authentication_failed");
});
%}

### 13. authenticated scope-rotation claim, but the owner holds NO group grant (non-key-holder) → 204
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "capabilityTags": ["663157d8"] }

> {%
client.test("non-key-holder ⇒ no rotation claimable", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 204, "expected 204, got " + response.status);
});
%}

### The third seam — the grant-delivery **decline** (cr-0098, ADR 0028). A worker holding a DIFFERENT identity
### pin refuses a grant-delivery job (release-to-others + this-worker exclusion). The blind boundaries provable
### over the wire: auth before anything, and a decline of an unknown job is a plain 404 (no lease adjudication
### leaks). The leased happy-path (release + per-worker exclusion + 409 not_lease_holder) is at the slice layer.

### 14. decline without a bearer token → generic 401 (auth before anything)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/decline
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "identity_changed" }

> {%
client.test("decline requires auth", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 401, "expected 401, got " + response.status);
    client.assert(response.body.code === "authentication_failed", "expected authentication_failed");
});
%}

### 15. decline an unknown job (authed) → 404 job_not_found (no leak of whether it was leased/by whom)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "identity_changed" }

> {%
client.test("decline unknown job ⇒ 404", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 404, "expected 404, got " + response.status);
    client.assert(response.body.code === "job_not_found", "expected job_not_found");
});
%}
